      "name": "Primary action",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "Shared action treatment; 48px minimum target.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-button-primary\">Explore the first activity</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-primary{font-family:\"Figtree Variable\",sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:18px;min-height:48px;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:8px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;font-weight:650;text-decoration:none;border:0;cursor:pointer;transition:background 150ms ease;background:var(--green, #286c36);color:#fff;} .ds-button-primary:hover{background:#1d5429;} .ds-button-primary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blue, #2d6fa3);outline-offset:5px} .ds-button-primary:disabled{cursor:default;opacity:.55;} @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button-primary{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Secondary action",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-secondary",
      "description": "Shared action treatment; 48px minimum target.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-button-secondary\">Give me a hint</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-secondary{font-family:\"Figtree Variable\",sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:18px;min-height:48px;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:8px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;font-weight:650;text-decoration:none;border:0;cursor:pointer;transition:background 150ms ease;background:#e9edef;color:var(--ink, #20262d);} .ds-button-secondary:hover{background:#dce3e7;} .ds-button-secondary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blue, #2d6fa3);outline-offset:5px} .ds-button-secondary:disabled{cursor:default;opacity:.55;} @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button-secondary{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Parent textarea",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "textarea",
      "description": "Body-font input for interests, prompts, and JSON.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-label\" for=\"ds-interests\">What captures their imagination?</label><textarea class=\"ds-textarea\" id=\"ds-interests\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"They love space and exploring new planets.\"></textarea>",
      "css": ".ds-label{font-family:\"Figtree Variable\",sans-serif;display:block;font-weight:700;margin:24px 0 8px;color:var(--ink, #20262d);}.ds-textarea{font-family:\"Figtree Variable\",sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;display:block;width:100%;border:1px solid #89959e;border-radius:8px;padding:14px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink, #20262d);resize:vertical;}.ds-textarea::placeholder{color:#5d6870}.ds-textarea:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blue, #2d6fa3);outline-offset:5px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Learning path stop",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "A readable objective accompanies every activity link.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-stop\" aria-label=\"Learning path\"><a href=\"#activity\"><span class=\"ds-number\">1</span><span><strong>Count together</strong><span class=\"ds-objective\">Compare and count small groups of shapes.</span></span><span class=\"ds-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2197</span></a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-stop{font-family:\"Figtree Variable\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink, #20262d);border-top:1px solid var(--line, #d6dce0);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line, #d6dce0);}.ds-stop a{display:grid;grid-template-columns:38px 1fr 22px;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:20px 4px;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}.ds-stop a:hover{background:#edf2f5}.ds-stop a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blue, #2d6fa3);outline-offset:5px}.ds-number{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:#e3ecf2;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#245779;font-weight:650;font-size:16px}.ds-stop strong{display:block;font-size:21px;font-weight:700}.ds-objective{display:block;font-size:15px;color:var(--muted, #4b555f);line-height:1.45;margin-top:4px}.ds-arrow{font-size:23px;color:var(--blue, #2d6fa3)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Answer choice",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "choice",
